axresdefault-600x338.jpg\" alt=\"maxresdefault-600x338.jpg\"&gt;&lt;div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;My boyfriend is best man at his best friends wedding. By the time the invitations went out we had been together for 5 months. By the time the wedding occurs will be 8 months. I was not invited to the wedding. I was however asked to work the Stag night with my boyfriend.&amp;nbsp;\n\nIs this not rude? Should I not go?&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897404,"PostDate":1432815566,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \t<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/maxresdefault-600x338.jpg\" alt=\"maxresdefault-600x338.jpg\"><\/span><div  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\">\u00a0<\/div><div  style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span>My boyfriend is best man at his best friends wedding. By the time the invitations went out we had been together for 5 months. By the time the wedding occurs will be 8 months. I was not invited to the wedding. I was however asked to work the Stag night with my boyfriend.\u00a0<br>\nIs this not rude? Should I not go?\u00a0<strong><a href='http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.adora.gr\/<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andrewmathew009@outlook.com","IpAddress":"117.204.29.223","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432799128,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"miracure","Id":283282,"Name":"miracure","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1182774b784d1dbef52f9bbdbd3940a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"miracure\"] - Is this a destination wedding? Regardless, I personally think that everyone should always be allowed a \"plus one\" if they are not being invited as part of&amp;nbsp;a couple. Unfortunately, though, people are allowed to invite whomever they chose since it&#039;s their wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If it&#039;s a destination wedding, they can&#039;t tell you that you can&#039;t go on the trip, but, sadly, they might not include you in the wedding festivities.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am not surprised that you weren&#039;t specifically addressed on the invitation because your relationship is still very new (and I truly don&#039;t&amp;nbsp;say that to be rude), but I am surprised if your boyfriend isn&#039;t being allowed a +1, which in this case would be you.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897423,"PostDate":1432829219,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283282\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283282-miracure\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">miracure<\/span><\/a> - Is this a destination wedding? Regardless, I personally think that everyone should always be allowed a \"plus one\" if they are not being invited as part of\u00a0a couple. Unfortunately, though, people are allowed to invite whomever they chose since it's their wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If it's a destination wedding, they can't tell you that you can't go on the trip, but, sadly, they might not include you in the wedding festivities.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am not surprised that you weren't specifically addressed on the invitation because your relationship is still very new (and I truly don't\u00a0say that to be rude), but I am surprised if your boyfriend isn't being allowed a +1, which in this case would be you.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402426389,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79221","Title":"Wedding Ediquette?","LastPostDate":1432829219},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
