ed to let those of you that don&#039;t yet have a dress for your wedding know that there is a new shopping spot!! I discovered this facebook page a few months back and they now have an online shopping website! Just like Tygrlily did with the dress of her dreams, I have been scouting around the website &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/Preownedweddingdresses.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/Preownedweddingdresses.com&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; There are some great deals there if you&#039;re on a tight budget, and it isn&#039;t all used dresses. You can find a great deal on either a sample or someone selling a dress who&#039;s wedding was maybe cancelled or changed their theme.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyway, the FB page that I was checking out finally got their online website up and going as of today and for the next 3 days they&#039;re offering 15% off what you buy. PLUS if they get 1800 likes over the next 3 days, they&#039;ll extend the 15% off for 2 extra days!!! Not a bad deal depending on what you&#039;re looking for. They do have some nice styles that would work for a beach wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I really thought my dress was done. It was totally what I wanted, but hubby asked me oh so nicely if we really had to spend that much money on it. He&#039;s right (gosh I really hate admitting that!!). It isn&#039;t our wedding. It&#039;s special but it isn&#039;t the main event so I&#039;m back to trying to either find what I want at a really great price, or something else that will work just as well as what I had picked out. I&#039;ve said before I want his jaw to drop! lol I really hope The Last Minute Bride can do that for me.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So here is their new website: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/thelastminutebride.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/thelastminutebride.com&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; Check it out. You have nothing to lose and might save some money! Heaven knows with the cost of some of the things the resorts charge for, saving is definitely an option!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892446,"PostDate":1428552143,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello brides to be!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wanted to let those of you that don't yet have a dress for your wedding know that there is a new shopping spot!! I discovered this facebook page a few months back and they now have an online shopping website! Just like Tygrlily did with the dress of her dreams, I have been scouting around the website <a href='http:\/\/Preownedweddingdresses.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/Preownedweddingdresses.com<\/a>\u00a0 There are some great deals there if you're on a tight budget, and it isn't all used dresses. You can find a great deal on either a sample or someone selling a dress who's wedding was maybe cancelled or changed their theme.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyway, the FB page that I was checking out finally got their online website up and going as of today and for the next 3 days they're offering 15% off what you buy. PLUS if they get 1800 likes over the next 3 days, they'll extend the 15% off for 2 extra days!!! Not a bad deal depending on what you're looking for. They do have some nice styles that would work for a beach wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I really thought my dress was done. It was totally what I wanted, but hubby asked me oh so nicely if we really had to spend that much money on it. He's right (gosh I really hate admitting that!!). It isn't our wedding. It's special but it isn't the main event so I'm back to trying to either find what I want at a really great price, or something else that will work just as well as what I had picked out. I've said before I want his jaw to drop! lol I really hope The Last Minute Bride can do that for me.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So here is their new website: <a href='http:\/\/thelastminutebride.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/thelastminutebride.com<\/a>\u00a0 Check it out. You have nothing to lose and might save some money! Heaven knows with the cost of some of the things the resorts charge for, saving is definitely an option!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e11682828c126a3055b073ba5e13e612","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you for that! I too am searching for a bargain! I am certain I will be buying either a used or sample dress and the savings are so worth it to me. I actually found my favorite dress on an online site and it was 400$ (1900$ brand new). I tried it on as the girl selling it lives in the same city as me and it was wayyyy to short :( I was so disappointed as the dress was in mint condition as she had gotten it dry cleaned and taken such good care of it. My wedding is 10 months away and I am hopeful I will find another sweet deal and the perfect dress! I&#039;m checking out that new site right now! Thank you and I hope you find your perfect dress too! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892472,"PostDate":1428589515,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you for that! I too am searching for a bargain! I am certain I will be buying either a used or sample dress and the savings are so worth it to me. I actually found my favorite dress on an online site and it was 400$ (1900$ brand new). I tried it on as the girl selling it lives in the same city as me and it was wayyyy to short <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> I was so disappointed as the dress was in mint condition as she had gotten it dry cleaned and taken such good care of it. My wedding is 10 months away and I am hopeful I will find another sweet deal and the perfect dress! I'm checking out that new site right now! Thank you and I hope you find your perfect dress too! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"millar_devon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423329313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282027.jpg?_r=1429713632","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Victoriabride","Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.94.109.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d28beeb25aacd8cbf5082d9b0b738ac3","RawContent":"ooh thanks for this info!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893160,"PostDate":1429068646,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                ooh thanks for this info!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaspbri0317@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.58.144.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1296688027,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=1429022808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaspbri0317","Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.226.231.229","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5275daa5c7d300886673f6a5d2e7468d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;there is a online wedding dresses shop too,they are cheap and free shipping :&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.ladyparks.com\/wedding-dresses-china-price&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.ladyparks.com\/wedding-dresses-china-price&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895171,"PostDate":1430558353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>there is a online wedding dresses shop too,they are cheap and free shipping :<a href='http:\/\/www.ladyparks.com\/wedding-dresses-china-price' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.ladyparks...ses-china-price<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.ladyparks.com\/wedding-dresses-china-price'>Cheap wedding dresses online shop Free shipping<\/a>","Email":"ljlau@outlook.com","IpAddress":"120.210.172.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430556642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282950.jpg?_r=1430557445","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ladyparks","Id":282950,"Name":"ladyparks","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"112.213.118.54","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd9a0be23f597e011a552a50f76687e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;have read your share.great!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;i also can share one store i always follow.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.gbridal.com\/wedding-party-dresses\/junior-bridesmaid-dresses.html&#039;&gt;www.gbridal.com\/wedding-party-dresses\/junior-bridesmaid-dresses.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897319,"PostDate":1432713808,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>have read your share.great!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>i also can share one store i always follow.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.gbridal.com\/wedding-party-dresses\/junior-bridesmaid-dresses.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.gbridal.com\/wedding-party-dresses\/junior-bridesmaid-dresses.html<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kaitlynakhurst@gmail.com","IpAddress":"112.213.118.54","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432711436,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"reberca","Id":283259,"Name":"reberca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.121.160.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79039,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"Tot